      "valueMarkdown": "Preventive Care and Wellness (Opportunity) test case. Mona (70) receives hospice care, so she meets the denominator exclusion of the breast cancer, colorectal cancer, and pneumococcal vaccination components (even though she has the services). Blood pressure and tobacco screening have no hospice exclusion, and she meets both. Component status: BCS: excluded; HBP: met; CCS: excluded; PVS: excluded; TSC group 1: met; TSC group 2: n/a. Counts are care opportunities (components): 5 in the denominator, 3 excluded, 0 exception, 2 met."
